sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Client Browser
    participant CLI as CLI Client<br/>(oc, curl)
    participant Envoy as Envoy Gateway
    participant Proxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP HTTP
    participant OIDC as OIDC Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OShift as OpenShift OAuth<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Upstream as Upstream App
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>6379/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Browser,Upstream: Flow 1: OIDC Authentication (Browser)
        Browser->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/start
        Proxy->>Browser: 302 Redirect to OIDC authorize
        Browser->>OIDC: GET /authorize<br/>client_id, PKCE challenge, nonce
        OIDC->>Browser: 302 Redirect with auth code
        Browser->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/callback<br/>code + CSRF cookie
        Proxy->>OIDC: POST /token<br/>client credentials, code, PKCE verifier<br/>TLS 1.2+
        OIDC-->>Proxy: ID token + access token
        Proxy->>Redis: Store session (AES-GCM encrypted)
        Proxy->>Browser: 302 Redirect + session cookie<br/>(HMAC-signed, AES-CFB encrypted)
        Browser->>Proxy: GET /* + session cookie
        Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with X-Forwarded-User,<br/>X-Forwarded-Email, X-Forwarded-Access-Token
        Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>Browser: Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over CLI,Upstream: Flow 2: OpenShift OAuth Bearer Token (CLI)
        CLI->>Proxy: GET /* + Bearer sha256~token
        Proxy->>OShift: GET /apis/user.openshift.io/v1/users/~<br/>Bearer sha256~token, TLS 1.2+
        OShift-->>Proxy: User info (name, email, groups)
        Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with X-Forwarded-User,<br/>X-Forwarded-Email
        Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>CLI: Response
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over CLI,Upstream: Flow 3: Kubernetes ServiceAccount Token (TokenReview)
        CLI->>Proxy: GET /* + Bearer SA token
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST TokenReview<br/>Service account token, TLS 1.2+ (in-cluster CA)
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview response<br/>(authenticated: true, user info)
        Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with X-Forwarded-User<br/>(system:serviceaccount:ns:name)
        Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>CLI: Response
    end

    rect rgb(248, 232, 248)
        Note over Envoy,Proxy: Flow 4: Envoy ext_authz Integration
        Envoy->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/auth<br/>Forwarded headers (Authorization, Cookie)
        alt Authenticated
            Proxy-->>Envoy: 202 Accept<br/>GAP-Auth: user@email.com
        else Not Authenticated
            Proxy-->>Envoy: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
        end
    end
